  "_": "Verifier provenance pin. Read back from chain with `cast codehash <addr> --rpc-url <the chain's RPC URL>`. The deploy scripts (DeployDarkMainnet.s.sol, DeployDarkTestnet.s.sol) refuse to wire a verifier whose address or runtime codehash is not in the entry for block.chainid, and pin the two shared libraries too: a library swapped at its pinned address changes verification without changing the verifier's own codehash. `verifierSolSha256` ties each row back to circuits/manifest.json, and scripts/check-verifier-pins.mjs enforces that tie in CI. Rows without it (the shared libraries, and the vault and registry) are not generated from a circuit; they are pinned so bytecode drift at their addresses can be detected."
